{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47150","headline":"耕田鼓诗 · 可朋","name":"耕田鼓诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"农舍田头鼓，王孙筵上鼓。\n击鼓兮皆爲鼓，一何乐兮一何苦。\n上有烈日，下有焦土。\n愿我天翁，降之以雨。\n令桑麻熟，仓箱富。\n不饥不寒，上下一般。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}